{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2021-07-28 17:03:00', 'title': 'KYNDRYL NAMES DAVID WYSHNER AS CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER', 'text': "ARMONK, N.Y., JULY 28, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KYNDRYL, THE NEW, INDEPENDENT PUBLIC COMPANY THAT WILL BE CREATED FOLLOWING THE SEPARATION OF IBM'S (NYSE: IBM) MANAGED INFRASTRUCTURE SERVICES BUSINESS, ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF DAVID WYSHNER AS THE COMPANY'S CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER."}